<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0711_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Anthony</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0711_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">By the way, I’m a Hiker, so I be in\nthe mountains and caves a lot.\rI don’t usually go to town.\rI bet you hit all kinds of towns on\nyour journey, don’t you?\rYou know, if we swapped\nnumbers, then we could swap\fall kinds of info, yeah? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0711_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’ll give you a call when I think of a\ngood, heart-warmin’ story, OK?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0711_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">That’s so sad. I might just end up\nlockin’ myself away on the mountain...\fThat’s my plan anyway. But sadder now.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0711_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">What you say?\nYou wanna swap numbers\fwith another adventurer? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0711_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You right nearby, and you still gon’\ncall me on the phone?\rAm I that “dazzlin’” that you gotta\nkeep your distance?\fI’m. I know I’m.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0711_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The other day, I watched my {STRVAR_1 0, 10, 0}\neat some Berries.\fIt was lovin’ it, so I tried some.\rI ain’t sure if people should eat that\nstuff, but it was BUSSIN’!\fI was sick for two days. Worth it.\rAight then! Be good!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0711_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lately, I been runnin’ into wild\n{STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0} a lot.\fThey light work.\rAight then!\nBe good!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0711_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I was scrappin’ this {STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0} the other\nday...\fIt dipped when I got distracted by a\fBeauty walkin’ by.\rLearn from my mistake--always stay\nlocked in!\fShe didn’t even look at me.\rAight then! Be good!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0711_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">C’mon--let’s scrap right now!\r{STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0} is where I’m at.\nC’mon over if you feel up to it!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0711_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wassup! You ain’t forgot about\nour scrap, have you?\r{STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}! I’m waitin’!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0711_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Why I like mountains so much...\rIt ain’t wrong to say I like the homies\nthat live on mountains.\rBut the number one reason is I just\nlike mountains.\rI got NO idea what a Swimmer♂’s\nthinkin’... Water is just flat ground\fyou can’t stand on.</language>
	</row>
</body>
